<title>USA: Apple South may buy back up to 1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Apple South may buy back up to 1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Ga. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple South Inc, after falling by more than 40 percent Wednesday to trade near 12 1/2, said it may buy back up to one million of its common stock through open market transactions.</p>
<p>The restaurant company said it completed a separate buy back of one million shares in July.</p>
